sections.body:
On this website:
• the contact form: your name, email address, company name and the message you write;
• booking a call: your name, email address, company name, what you want to solve, the time you pick and your time zone, plus how you reached the site (for example the post, ad or website you came from);
• analytics, only if you accept cookies (see below).

In the Adapto Tracker:
• the email addresses you add to receive project updates and meeting invites;
• meetings you or we propose: title, note, date and time, time zone and the email of who proposed it;
• messages you send us from your project page, with the email you reply from;
• for our team members, their login email and password, managed by our authentication provider.

While working on a project: the information you choose to share with us, such as contact details of your team, business documents, files, content and access to accounts we need to build or run your product.

Automatically: like most websites, our servers record technical data such as your IP address, browser and the time of each request. We use it to keep the services secure (for example, to block repeated wrong access codes) and to fix problems.

We use personal information only to:
• reply to you and discuss a possible project;
• deliver the project we agreed on, including the Adapto Tracker, its notifications and its meetings;
• keep our services secure and working;
• understand, in aggregate, how this website is used, if you allow analytics;
• know which posts and ads bring calls, and measure our advertising on Meta, if you allow it;
• meet our legal and accounting obligations.

We do this with your consent (analytics and advertising cookies, notification emails you confirm), because it is needed to provide the services you ask for (replying, running your project and the Tracker), or because of our legitimate interest in keeping our services secure. We never sell your data, and what you type in our forms is never shared with advertising platforms.

We share personal information only with the service providers that help us run our services, and only what each one needs:
• Vercel: hosting of this website and the Tracker;
• Supabase: the Tracker's database and team sign-in;
• Resend: delivery of our emails (contact form, Tracker notifications and invitations);
• Google: Analytics (if you allow it), Calendar and Meet (meetings and call bookings);
• Meta: the Pixel, only if you allow it (see Analytics and cookies);
• WhatsApp (Meta) and Apple: only if you choose to message us through them.

Each provider processes the data on our behalf under its own security and privacy commitments. We may also disclose information when the law requires it. We do not sell your data and we do not share it with anyone else.
